Z||000020||Sillhouette.com||02-09-2001||07:31 PM||||I truly stay away from London Ontario as much as possible here is why.  <P>Three years ago there was a SOLO race held there by some redneck.  It ended up being in the parking lot of a major mall.  We asked him at the begining if the noise would bother anyone but they said that it's OK so give us your money.  We payed and after two runs the cops show up (there is a police academy there as well green eared cops with the procedures book in one hand the tickets in the other)  Finally we (RSM and I) got banned because our mufflers were too loud.  There were a couple of other cars as well that got banned.  When we went to inquire about the money they told us that it's not refundable and if we want to run we have to go to Canadian tire and get a quiter muffler.   <P>Only in Canada and only in London can something like this happen.  <P>Quite embarrasing.<P>Later||||reg||1
