Z||000040||Slammed Fiero||02-14-2001||07:03 PM||||Sillhouette.com ..you mentioned you and RSM were told to leave an autocross. a few years back at our Regional event at mountianview Zolst showed up with his car , if it weren't on an airfield away from people we would have kicked him off too. The car is too damm loud , there's no point to it , it can't be making that much more power. I have run my 87 Vette with open exhaust and just resonators and it's quietier than that car.. This was before his SC...so it may have toned down a bit. It wasn't the first time he has been booted for sound.<P><BR>JM <BR><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
