Z||000043||Sillhouette.com||02-14-2001||10:19 PM||||Man Slammed Fiero you sure have your facts messed up. Allow me to clear them up for you.  Being booted from London was no biggie.  The problem was that they were not receptive to this and told us to go to Canadian Tire to change the muffler on a Sunday.  Question .... Would you take your vette to canadian tire to change your muffler?<P>Next I was also at your race in kingston that was held at an airport.  I don't know why you bring up stories since I know for a Fact the Zsolt came in third and Dave came in second with their fieros beaten by a Nissan 240SX heavily modified.  What was your placing?<P>P.S. just to clarify the LONDON race was Illegal thank god we got booted otherwise we could have spent a day in prison because of those rednecks (the organizers)<BR>Having been to a lot of solo races the RSM loud fiero got only booted out of London nowhere else. <P>Later||||reg||1
